      "date": "2014-07-14T17:13:35+0800",
      "is_op": true,
      "url": "https://archive.geoclicks.com/threads/sheets-for-space-saver-cot.169374/#post-1186966",
      "page": 1,
      "body": "Hi, I've bought a space saver cot and finding it hard to find any sheets to fit. I'd like a mattress protector and fitted sheets ideally. Any ideas? Shops in central or DB would be v convenient for me.\n\nThanks in advance!",
      "body_with_quotes": "Hi, I've bought a space saver cot and finding it hard to find any sheets to fit. I'd like a mattress protector and fitted sheets ideally. Any ideas? Shops in central or DB would be v convenient for me.\n\nThanks in advance!",
      "raw_file": "_raw/oblique-deep/threads/geo-169374-p001.html.gz"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "post-1187502",
      "author_id": "80410",
      "date": "2014-07-18T18:42:18+0800",
      "is_op": false,
      "url": "https://archive.geoclicks.com/threads/sheets-for-space-saver-cot.169374/#post-1187502",
      "page": 1,
      "body": "Hi Rachi\n\nDo you mean a cot that fits a 90cm*45cm mattress? Tiny Footprints in Central sells Bloom's Alma Mini cot which might be the same size as your space saver cot (alma mini crib) - give them a try, they should sell fitted sheets and mattress protectors that work for that size. Good luck!",
      "body_with_quotes": "Hi Rachi\n\nDo you mean a cot that fits a 90cm*45cm mattress? Tiny Footprints in Central sells Bloom's Alma Mini cot which might be the same size as your space saver cot (alma mini crib) - give them a try, they should sell fitted sheets and mattress protectors that work for that size. Good luck!",
